## 2. Tenure (year / 365-day windows)

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Tenure.java`** — the single definition of tenure as whole days since registration, floored at 0 for null/future dates:

```java
public static long days(LocalDate registrationDate) {
    if (registrationDate == null) {
        return 0;
    }
    return Math.max(ChronoUnit.DAYS.between(registrationDate, LocalDate.now()), 0);
}
```

Consumed by `OwnerMapper.membershipPoints(...)` — `if (Tenure.days(owner.getRegistrationDate()) > 365) { points += 3; }` — the 365-day window.

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/AgeBand.java`** — a related whole-years computation (`Period.between(birthDate, registrationDate).getYears()`) mapping to `MINOR`/`ADULT`/`SENIOR`, used by `OwnerMapper.ageBand(...)`.

